{
 "name": "throw3-egg-hatch-repeat",
 "about": "[проверить] 128 downward diagonal throws: enough independent hatch trials for spawn tick/order, yaw, initial head rotation and baby metadata. Inspect raw trajectories and condition on hatching; do not pair random hatch counts between servers. Also provides a larger launch-spread sample.",
